    "Simplified invoicing and electronic billing for small businesses" : "為小型企業提供簡化的發票及電子開票方案",
    "# Run your business with Gestion\nGestion is a Nextcloud application designed to make invoicing simple, secure, and efficient for freelancers, micro-enterprises, and small businesses.\n\nKey Features:\n* Add and manage customer profiles\n* Create and customize product entries\n* Generate professional quotes and invoices in PDF format\n* Generate electronic invoices in the Factur-X format\n* Send PDFs directly by email from the application\n* Store generated documents securely within your Nextcloud instance\n* Track your business activities more efficiently\n\n✨ Electronic invoicing is supported in France. Gestion can generate Factur-X invoices that combine a human-readable PDF with structured electronic invoice data.\n\nFactur-X files can always be generated and downloaded without using an external platform. Each company can also select and configure a compatible approved electronic invoicing platform.\n\nThe PDF generation system has also been redesigned to improve document layout, styling, and compatibility.\n\nGestion integrates seamlessly with the Nextcloud ecosystem and keeps your business data under your control.\n\nIf you require adaptations to comply with your country's regulations, please open an issue on the GitHub repository.\n\n[![Donate](https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-Buy%20me%20a%20coffee-yellow.svg)](https://www.buymeacoffee.com/benjaminaimard)" : "# 使用 Gestion 管理你的業務\nGestion 是一款 Nextcloud 應用程式，專為自由工作者、微型企業及小型企業而設，旨在讓開立發票變得簡單、安全及高效率。\n\n主要功能：\n* 新增及管理客戶資料\n* 建立及自訂產品項目\n* 產生專業報價單及 PDF 發票\n* 產生 Factur-X 格式的電子發票\n* 直接在應用程式內以電郵傳送 PDF\n* 將產生的文件安全儲存在你的 Nextcloud 執行個體中\n* 更有效率地追蹤業務活動\n\n✨ Gestion 現已支援法國的電子發票。Gestion 可產生 Factur-X 發票，將人類可閱讀的 PDF 與結構化電子發票資料結合。\n\nFactur-X 檔案可隨時產生及下載，無須使用任何外部平台。各公司亦可自行選擇及設定相容的核准電子發票平台。\n\nPDF 產生系統亦已重新設計，以改善文件版面、樣式及相容性。\n\nGestion 可與 Nextcloud 生態系統無縫整合，讓你的業務資料始終由你掌控。\n\n如需配合你所在國家或地區的法規要求作出調整，請到 GitHub 儲存庫提交 issue。\n\n[![Donate](https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-Buy%20me%20a%20coffee-yellow.svg)](https://www.buymeacoffee.com/benjaminaimard)",
