    "The operation could not be completed. Check whether the document or its linked data is locked." : "無法完成操作。請檢查文件或其關聯資料是否已鎖定。",
    "Finalizing permanently locks this invoice and its linked quote. They can no longer be edited or deleted, including payment fields. Linked customer, product and company details are protected. PDF downloads remain available." : "完成定稿後，此發票及其關聯報價單將永久鎖定，不能再編輯或刪除，包括付款欄位。相關客戶、產品及公司資料亦會受到保護。仍可下載 PDF。",
    "Sending finalizes and permanently locks the invoice and its linked quote before the delivery attempt. If delivery fails, they remain locked and you can retry sending. Canceling does not lock or send anything." : "傳送前會先將發票及其關聯報價單定稿並永久鎖定。即使傳送失敗，文件仍會保持鎖定，你可重試傳送。取消操作則不會鎖定或傳送任何文件。",
    "Sending a quote does not lock it. It remains editable unless a linked invoice is finalized. Canceling does not send anything." : "傳送報價單不會將其鎖定。除非關聯發票已定稿，否則仍可編輯。取消操作則不會傳送任何文件。",
    "This invoice and its linked quote are locked and cannot be edited or deleted. PDF downloads remain available." : "此發票及其關聯報價單已鎖定，不能編輯或刪除。仍可下載 PDF。",
    "This quote is locked because a linked invoice has been finalized. It cannot be edited or deleted. PDF downloads remain available." : "由於關聯發票已定稿，此報價單已鎖定，不能編輯或刪除。仍可下載 PDF。",
