    "Welcome to GESTION" : "歡迎來到 GESTION",
    "Gestion is developed and maintained by its author in his free time. Your support helps keep the project active, improve the application and answer users. If Gestion is useful to you, you can support the project by buying the author a coffee. Even a €1 contribution is a meaningful gesture and helps the project move forward." : "Gestion 由作者利用業餘時間開發及維護。你的支持有助項目持續發展、改進應用程式並回應用戶。如 Gestion 對你有幫助，你可請作者喝杯咖啡以支持此項目。即使只是 €1 的支持亦別具意義，並有助項目繼續向前發展。",
    "Support Gestion by buying a coffee" : "請作者喝杯咖啡以支持 Gestion",
