    "This version adds data recovery, document protection and a refreshed Nextcloud workspace." : "此版本新增資料復原、文件保護功能，並更新 Nextcloud 工作空間。",
    "Back up your companies and restore them safely into new companies." : "備份公司資料，並安全地還原為新公司。",
    "Finalize documents and protect linked customer, product and company data." : "將文件定稿，並保護相關客戶、產品及公司資料。",
    "Apply commercial discounts per line, including in PDF and Factur-X calculations." : "為個別項目套用商業折扣，並計入 PDF 及 Factur-X 的計算。",
    "Choose the display precision for prices and quantities without truncating stored values." : "選擇價格及數量的顯示精度，而不截斷已儲存的數值。",
    "Review changes by date and author in the company history." : "在公司變更記錄中按日期及修改者查看變更。",
