    "Delete company" : "刪除公司",
    "Deletion is permanent. Companies with finalized documents are protected. Download a backup before deleting a company." : "刪除後無法復原。含有已定稿文件的公司受到保護。刪除公司前請先下載備份。",
    "Add quote" : "添加新報價",
    "Internal identifier of the Nextcloud user associated with the quote. It is generated by the application and is not a legal quote number." : "與報價單相關聯的 Nextcloud 用戶內部識別碼。此識別碼由應用程式產生，並非具法律效力的報價單編號。",
    "ID" : "ID",
    "Enter the date on which the quote is issued. In France, the issue date is mandatory when a quote is legally required." : "輸入報價單的發出日期。在法國，如法律規定必須提供報價單，發出日期亦屬必填資料。",
    "Quote date" : "報價日期",
    "Enter a clear and unique business reference for the quote so it can be identified and linked to an invoice." : "為報價單輸入清晰且唯一的業務參考編號，以便識別並與發票連結。",
    "Select the customer receiving the quote. For French mandatory quotes, the customer name and address must be stated." : "選擇接收報價單的客戶。對法國法例規定必須提供的報價單，必須列明客戶名稱及地址。",
    "Customer quote" : "報價編號",
    "Enter the revision number of the quote, for example 1.0 or 2.0. Increase it when issuing a materially revised quote." : "輸入報價單的修訂版本號，例如 1.0 或 2.0。如報價單有重大修訂，應提高版本號。",
    "Enter the current quote status, for example Draft, Sent, Accepted, Rejected or Expired. An accepted quote can become binding evidence of the agreement." : "輸入目前的報價單狀態，例如「草稿」、「已傳送」、「已接受」、「已拒絕」或「已過期」。已接受的報價單可成為具約束力的協議證明。",
    "Status" : "狀態",
    "Use the actions menu to open, download, duplicate or delete the quote. Keep accepted quotes for the retention period applicable to your business." : "使用操作選單開啟、下載、複製或刪除報價單。已接受的報價單應按適用於你業務的保存期限保留。",
    "Add product" : "添加商品",
