    "footer image" : "頁腳圖像",
    "Company logo" : "公司圖示",
    "Issuer" : "發行者",
    "Recipient" : "收件人",
    "You can add your company logo here." : "您可以在此處添加您公司的圖示。",
    "To add the main logo, use the numeric company ID shown in the company selector as the filename prefix (for example, company 1 uses 1logo.png). Place the file in the \".gestion\" folder at the root of Nextcloud Files and enable \"Show hidden files\" to display this folder." : "要新增主要標誌，請使用公司選擇器中顯示的公司數字 ID 作為檔案名稱前綴（例如，公司 1 使用 1logo.png）。請將檔案放在 Nextcloud「檔案」根目錄的「.gestion」資料夾內，並啟用「顯示隱藏檔案」以顯示此資料夾。",
    "Add invoice" : "添加發票",
    "Internal identifier of the Nextcloud user associated with the invoice. It is generated by the application and is not the legal invoice number." : "與發票相關聯的 Nextcloud 用戶內部識別碼。此識別碼由應用程式產生，並非具法律效力的發票編號。",
    "Enter the invoice number. In France, it is mandatory and must be unique within a chronological, continuous and gap-free sequence." : "輸入發票編號。在法國，發票編號屬必填資料，並必須在按時間順序、連續且無缺號的編號序列中保持唯一。",
    "Invoice number" : "發票號碼",
    "Enter the actual delivery date or the date on which the service was completed. This date is mandatory on French invoices." : "輸入實際交付日期或服務完成日期。此日期在法國發票上屬必填資料。",
    "Date of service" : "服務日期",
    "Enter the payment due date. French business invoices must state the due date or applicable payment terms." : "輸入付款到期日。法國企業發票必須列明到期日或適用的付款條款。",
    "Payment date" : "付款日期",
    "Select the expected payment method using the structured code: cash, cheque, credit transfer, payment card or SEPA credit transfer." : "使用結構化代碼選擇預期付款方式：現金、支票、銀行轉帳、付款卡或 SEPA 銀行轉帳。",
    "Select the quote from which this invoice is created. This links the invoice to its accepted commercial terms and customer." : "選擇建立此發票所依據的報價單。這會將發票與已接受的商業條款及客戶資料連結。",
    "Associated quote" : "相關報價",
    "Enter the internal document revision. Do not reuse or alter the legal number of an issued French invoice; issue a corrective document when required." : "輸入內部文件修訂版本。已發出的法國發票不得重用或更改其法定編號；如有需要，應發出更正文件。",
    "Enter the payment status, for example Pending, Paid, Partially paid, Overdue or Cancelled. Keep it consistent with the payment due date." : "輸入付款狀態，例如「待付款」、「已付款」、「部分付款」、「逾期」或「已取消」。狀態應與付款到期日保持一致。",
    "Use the actions menu to open, download, duplicate or delete the invoice. In France, issued invoices are accounting records and must be retained; do not delete them to correct an error." : "使用操作選單開啟、下載、複製或刪除發票。在法國，已發出的發票屬會計記錄並必須保存；請勿以刪除發票方式更正錯誤。",
    "Send to Iopole" : "傳送至 Iopole",
    "Settlement date" : "結算日期",
    "Customer" : "顧客",
    "Add customer" : "添加顧客",
    "Import from Contacts" : "從聯絡人匯入",
    "Enter the customer company or legal business name. In France, the buyer identity must appear on invoices." : "輸入客戶的公司名稱或法定商業名稱。在法國，發票必須列明買方身分。",
    "Enter the customer first name. Use it with the last name for an individual customer or contact." : "輸入客戶的名字。個人客戶或聯絡人應連同姓氏一併使用。",
    "Enter the customer last name. In France, an individual buyer must be identified by name on the invoice." : "輸入客戶的姓氏。在法國，個人買方必須以姓名在發票上識別。",
    "Enter additional legal information to display on customer documents, such as legal form, registration details or a specific legal notice." : "輸入要在客戶文件上顯示的其他法律資料，例如法律形式、註冊資料或特定法律聲明。",
    "Legal information" : "法律資訊",
    "Enter the business identifier. For a French business customer, use the 9-digit SIREN. The customer SIREN is required for French electronic invoicing where applicable from 1 September 2026." : "輸入企業識別碼。法國企業客戶應使用 9 位數字的 SIREN。凡適用於法國電子發票規定，客戶 SIREN 自 2026 年 9 月 1 日起屬必填資料。",
    "Company identification/Siren" : "公司識別碼／SIREN",
    "Enter the customer intra-Community VAT number when applicable. A French VAT number contains FR, a 2-digit key and the 9-digit SIREN. It is required on French invoices in particular when the business customer is liable for VAT, including reverse charge cases." : "如適用，輸入客戶的歐盟內增值稅號碼。法國增值稅號碼由 FR、2 位數字校驗碼及 9 位數字 SIREN 組成。特別是在企業客戶須繳增值稅（包括反向徵稅）的情況下，此號碼須列於法國發票。",
    "Intra-community VAT" : "歐盟內增值稅號碼",
    "Enter a customer contact phone number, preferably with its international country prefix. This is contact information and is not a general mandatory invoice field in France." : "輸入客戶聯絡電話號碼，建議包括國際國家／地區代碼。此屬聯絡資料，並非法國發票的一般必填欄位。",
    "Enter a valid customer email address used for contact and document delivery. This is not a general mandatory invoice field in France." : "輸入有效的客戶電郵地址，用於聯絡及傳送文件。此並非法國發票的一般必填欄位。",
    "Enter the street and number of the customer address. In France, the buyer address and any distinct billing address must appear on invoices." : "輸入客戶地址的街道及門牌號碼。在法國，發票必須列明買方地址以及任何不同的帳單地址。",
    "Enter the postal code for the customer address. Use the 5-digit postal code for a standard French address." : "輸入客戶地址的郵遞區號。一般法國地址使用 5 位數字郵遞區號。",
    "Zip code" : "郵政編碼",
    "Enter the city or locality of the customer address. It forms part of the mandatory buyer address on French invoices." : "輸入客戶地址的城市或地區。此資料屬法國發票上買方地址的必填部分。",
    "City name" : "城市名稱",
    "Enter the customer country using its ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code, for example FR for France. Country information is required for structured electronic invoice addresses." : "使用 ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 代碼輸入客戶所在國家，例如法國使用 FR。結構化電子發票地址必須包含國家資料。",
    "Country code" : "國家代碼",
    "Use this column to delete the customer record. Deletion cannot be used to replace legally required invoice retention." : "使用此欄刪除客戶記錄。刪除客戶記錄不能取代法律規定的發票保存義務。",
    "Legal notice" : "法律聲明",
    "This section provides information pertaining to the use of this application under the legal framework applicable in various countries." : "本節提供有關在各個國家/地區適用的法律框架下使用此應用程式的資訊。",
    "If you want to contribute to this section just contact me by mail" : "如果您想為本節做出貢獻，請通過郵件與我聯絡",
    "Product" : "商品",
    "Enter a unique internal reference or SKU used to identify the product or service consistently." : "輸入唯一的內部參考編號或 SKU，以一致識別產品或服務。",
    "Enter a precise description of the supplied product or service. A clear designation is mandatory on French invoices." : "輸入所提供產品或服務的準確描述。法國發票必須清楚列明項目名稱。",
    "Enter the unit price before VAT in the configured invoice currency. The unit price excluding VAT is mandatory on French invoices when line details are required." : "以已設定的發票貨幣輸入未連增值稅的單價。如發票須列明明細，未連增值稅單價在法國發票上屬必填資料。",
    "Enter the applicable VAT rate as a number, for example 20 for 20 percent. French invoices must distinguish the applicable VAT rate and related tax amount when VAT applies." : "以數字輸入適用的增值稅率，例如 20 表示 20%。如適用增值稅，法國發票必須分別列明適用稅率及相關稅額。",
    "VAT percentage" : "增值稅百分比",
    "Choose S for VAT at 5.5%%, 10%% or 20%%; E for a VAT-exempt supply, then verify its exemption reason in Actions; Z for a legally zero-rated taxable supply; O for an operation outside the scope of VAT; AE for reverse charge; G for export outside the EU; or K for an intra-Community supply." : "增值稅率為 5.5%%、10%% 或 20%% 時選擇 S；豁免增值稅的供應選擇 E，然後在「操作」中核對豁免原因；依法採用零稅率的應稅供應選擇 Z；不屬增值稅範圍的交易選擇 O；反向徵稅選擇 AE；出口至歐盟以外地區選擇 G；歐盟內供應選擇 K。",
    "VAT category (France only)" : "增值稅類別（僅限法國）",
